==English==
{{wikipedia}}
[[File:Coal anthracite.jpg|thumb|A nugget of anthracite '''coal'''.]]

===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*ǵwelH-}}
From {{inh|en|enm|cole}}, from {{inh|en|ang|col}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*kol}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*kulą}} (compare {{cog|fy|koal}}, {{cog|nl|kool}}, {{cog|de|Kohle}}, {{cog|da|kul}}), from {{m|ine-pro|*ǵwelH-||to burn, shine}}.

Compare {{cog|sga|gúal||coal}}, {{cog|lt|žvìlti||to twinkle, glow}}, {{cog|fa|زغال|tr=zoğâl||live coal}}, {{cog|sa|ज्वल्||to burn, glow}}, {{cog|txb|śoliye||hearth}}, all from the same root.

